(122, 31, 'bio', 'Audre works in our main warehouse to process incoming and outgoing shipments. An integral part of the quality\r\nprocess, Audre is the first and last set of eyes on incoming and outgoing material. We rely on Audre’s organization to\r\nmaintain the integrity of our inventory.'),
