(130, 32, '_designation', 'field_64a3cf1b65652'),
(131, 32, 'bio', 'Ashley is the office authority who has a pulse on all facets of the company. She works with management to organize and\r\ndeliver important information about job updates and schedules to technicians.\r\nWhen not managing the manufacturing process, Ashley also acts as our Accounts Payable and Receivable, handling all\r\nbilling inquiries. '),
