(2696, 415, 'benefites', '<p>Our users tend to prefer Omnifit columns over other industry leaders due to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> 🞄 A single glass wall construction that provides greater clarity and robust architecture</li>\r\n<li> 🞄 Replaceable frits and strong PEEK threads that allow for disassembly and re-use</li>\r\n<li> 🞄 A glass-to-PTFE seal to minimize leaks</li>\r\n<li> 🞄 Adjustable end pieces to give the user a total of 160mm to change bed lengths</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n'),
