(4435, 43, 'quality_text', 'At Bioprocess Supplies, we strive to not only meet our customer\'s requirements but exceed them by ensuring compliance with regulatory standards and delivering high-quality products.\r\n\r\nBioprocess Supplies has a full ISO 9001 and 13485 certified Quality Management system, as well as two ISO class 7 certified cleanroom manufacturing environments.\r\n\r\nBy focusing on customer satisfaction, regulatory compliance, and product quality, Bioprocess Supplies is committed to supporting our clients with products that meet their needs and regulatory standards.'),
