(180, 1, '2023-07-10 03:08:46', '2023-07-10 03:08:46', '<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"postbox__content-area mb-60\">\r\n<h4>Our Approach</h4>\r\n<div class=\"postbox__text mb-30\">\r\n<p>Must explain to you how all praising uts pain was <br> born and I will gives you a itself completed <br> account of the system, and sed expounds the ut <br> actual teachings of that greater </p>\r\n<div class=\"postbox__text-list\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i>Extramural Funding</li>\r\n<li><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i>Bacteria Markers</li>\r\n<li><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i>Nam nec mi euismod euismod</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"postbox__meta-img w-img mb-60\"><img src=\"assets/img/blog/b2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n<div class=\"postbox__content-area mb-40\">\r\n<h4 class=\"mb-25\"><a href=\"blog-details.html\">What Is A Business Technology Roadmap?</a></h4>\r\n<p>Unlike detailed blueprints that lay out all tasks, deadlines, bug reports, and more along the way, technology roadmaps are high-level visual summaries highlighting a company’s vision or plans.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>In an Agile approach, a technology roadmap feeds the sprint and grooming processes, providing insight into how the product will travel from start to finish. It makes it easier for development teams to:</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"postbox__meta-img mb-60\">\r\n<img src=\"http://off-ce.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/b2.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\">\r\n<div class=\"postbox__meta-img mb-60\">\r\n<img src=\"http://off-ce.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/b3.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Lavoratories used for scientic reseach take many froms.', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '176-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-07-10 03:08:46', '2023-07-10 03:08:46', '', 176, 'http://off-ce.com/?p=180', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(181, 1, '2023-07-10 03:47:39', '2023-07-10 03:47:39', '<p>Custom bottle assemblies are available in a wide array of sizes. Unlike most other vendors of single use bottle systems, we not only offer customization of the cap, but can integrate portage directly into the walls of the bottle itself without compromising the structure and rigidity.</p>\r\n<p>If your organization already has a selection of bottles, we can provide custom cap assemblies separately. Cap customization ranges from 1 to 3 ports and can be configured with or without a dip-tube.</p>\r\n', 'Bottles', 'Skip the cleaning and sterilization of your reusable bottles and confidently store fluids in our PETG gamma\r\nirradiated bottle systems. With multiple port options, the customization of these bottles is endless. Check out our\r\nstandardized bottle systems or contact us to create the perfect design for your process.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bottles', '', '', '2025-12-18 12:05:17', '2025-12-18 12:05:17', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=181', 0, 'products', '', 0),
