(368, 1, '2023-09-25 10:48:25', '2023-09-25 10:48:25', '<p>If your vendors are missing deadlines, Bioprocess Supplies is here to help you source on time or find suitable alternatives. We keep stock of components from our top suppliers, including:</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Eldon James</td>\r\n<td>Colder Products Company &nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>Fluidflow</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Sartorius</td>\r\n<td>New Age</td>\r\n<td>VWR</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Accuflow Systems &nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>Watson Marlow &nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>Saint-Gobain</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Contact us for availability and lead time. If you need something we don’t carry, chances are that we can get it!</p>', 'Components', 'We work with the leading biopharma extruders to keep our clients up to date with the latest in single-use technology. We keep stock of a variety of connectors, clamps, and filters in polypropylene, polysulfone, polycarbonate. Call us to discuss the latest in aseptic connection and disconnection technology.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'components', '', '', '2025-12-18 11:53:41', '2025-12-18 11:53:41', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=368', 0, 'products', '', 0),
