(371, 1, '2023-09-26 04:00:55', '2023-09-26 04:00:55', '<p>The possibilities of our custom tubing assemblies are endless. Whether your process is aseptic, requires welding, or demands a unique manifold system, our designers are here to equip you with knowledge of the latest and greatest in the single-use industry. We’ll help you reduce costs, optimize the system, and get the job done right.</p>\r\n<p>Tubing assemblies can be integrated with all product categories on the Bioprocess Supplies site. Call us today to develop your process.</p>\r\n', 'Tubing Assemblies', 'No need to stop production for sterilization! Take advantage of our gamma sterilized tubing\r\nassemblies to increase the efficiency of your process. Dimensions or materials not compatible for your project\r\nspecifications? Contact us to get started in designing a custom assembly that meets the necessary requirements', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'tubing-assemblies-2', '', '', '2023-11-24 06:27:48', '2023-11-24 06:27:48', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=371', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(372, 1, '2023-09-26 04:03:30', '2023-09-26 04:03:30', '<p>LDPE Drums are available in sizes ranging from 50 to 500L, feature an extra heavy construction, and have an external flange/lip.</p>\r\n<p>Drums can be paired with lids, liners, or even a 3D bag system to develop a complete mixing platform or bioprocessing station.</p>\r\n<p>Purchase drums from Bioprocess Supplies and ensure your liners fit perfectly every time with our custom designed liners, optimized specifically for the drums that we offer.</p>\r\n', 'Drums', 'Looking to mix, store, or transfer reagents? Check out our line of cylindrical polypropylene storage drums to\r\nproperly store your bioprocessing fluids. For your mixing purposes, we offer a range of sizes of Low Density Polyethylene\r\n(LDPE) mixing cylindrical drums. Contact us to find the size needed for your projects!', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'drums', '', '', '2023-11-24 06:24:44', '2023-11-24 06:24:44', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=372', 0, 'products', '', 0),
