(383, 1, '2023-09-26 04:26:27', '2023-09-26 04:26:27', '<b>Head Plates: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Have an accessory for use with your bioreactor but no way to mount it? Call us to discuss machining a custom adaptor or even an entirely custom configured headplate.</span>\r\n\r\n<b>Bolt Kits: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stripping bolts is never an easy fix, and can cause delays for your bioreactor runs. Our adjustable bolt kits are custom designed for the geometry of your headplate and feature limited thread to avoid stripping. </span>', 'Bolt Kits & Head-plates', 'Custom head plates and bolts for any bioreactor- made from high quality stainless steel.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bolt-kits-head-plates', '', '', '2025-12-18 11:49:24', '2025-12-18 11:49:24', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=383', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(384, 1, '2023-09-26 04:26:54', '2023-09-26 04:26:54', 'We can meet the demands of your next project no matter the size. We will work with you to create a\r\ncustomized kit to fulfill your specific needs. Our single use bioreactor kits are built in an ISO Class 7 cleanroom and are\r\npackaged and ready for desired sterilization. Work with our team to choose tubing and componentry to enable a faster\r\nturnaround, minimize labor costs, and lessen the chances of contamination in your next run.', 'Reactor Lines', 'We can meet the demands of your next project no matter the size. We will work with you to create a\r\ncustomized kit to fulfill your specific needs. Our single use bioreactor kits are built in an ISO Class 7 cleanroom and are\r\npackaged and ready for desired sterilization. Work with our team to choose tubing and componentry to enable a faster\r\nturnaround, minimize labor costs, and lessen the chances of contamination in your next run.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'reactor-lines', '', '', '2023-11-01 10:14:52', '2023-11-01 10:14:52', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=384', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(385, 1, '2023-09-26 04:27:18', '2023-09-26 04:27:18', 'We can meet the demands of your next project no matter the size. We will work with you to create a customized kit to fulfill your specific needs. Our single use bioreactor kits are built in an ISO Class 7 cleanroom and are packaged and ready for desired sterilization. Work with our team to choose tubing and componentry to enable a faster turnaround, minimize labor costs, and lessen the chances of contamination in your next run.', 'Bio-Reactor Kits & Accessories', 'Work with our designers to create custom fittings to mate capital equipment with your Bioreactors.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bio-reactor-accessories', '', '', '2023-11-29 16:39:33', '2023-11-29 16:39:33', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=385', 0, 'products', '', 0),
