(411, 1, '2023-09-28 05:36:59', '2023-09-28 05:36:59', '', 'TFF Systems', '<p>Have a large ATF/TFF system and don’t want to be tied to the manufacturer for the single-use portion? We’ll make the measurements and design an optimized replacement set.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contact us to discuss having Bioprocess Supplies replace the single-use sections of tubing on your high performance filtration systems. Salespeople are available for in-person visitation and measurement depending upon location.</p>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'tff-systems', '', '', '2023-11-29 06:11:34', '2023-11-29 06:11:34', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=411', 0, 'products', '', 0),
