(413, 1, '2023-09-28 05:39:15', '2023-09-28 05:39:15', '2D bags compatible with harvest solution and downstream drug product. Designed for maximum yield.', 'TFF Bags', '2D bags compatible with harvest solution and downstream drug product. Designed for maximum yield.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'tff-bags', '', '', '2023-11-01 07:42:16', '2023-11-01 07:42:16', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=413', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(414, 1, '2023-09-28 05:40:27', '2023-09-28 05:40:27', '    Adjustable bed heights and reusable hardware- we source industry leading resins at an affordable rate. Packed and shipped from New Jersey, our supplier’s local distribution and advanced shipping practices ensure that your columns arrive without air bubbles or cracked walls. Repacking services available.', 'Chromatography Columns', 'Adjustable bed heights and reusable hardware- we source industry leading resins at an affordable rate. Packed and shipped from New Jersey, our supplier’s local distribution and advanced shipping practices ensure that your columns arrive without air bubbles or cracked walls. Repacking services available.', 'draft', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'chromatography-columns', '', '', '2023-11-23 07:17:42', '2023-11-23 07:17:42', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=414', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(415, 1, '2023-09-28 05:41:18', '2023-09-28 05:41:18', '<!--Connections available for column to HP/LPLC equipment. Featuring FEP tubing and a flange designed to reduce the number of times your FEP lines kink.-->\r\n\r\n<strong>Omnifit Columns:</strong>\r\n<p>Adjustable bed heights and reusable hardware. We source from New Jersey and our supplier’s local distribution and advanced shipping practices ensure that your columns arrive without air bubbles or cracked walls.</p> \r\n<p>All columns come fully assembled and ready for use.</p>\r\n<p>Column packing and repacking/swapping services are available. Please reach out with your needs and we can compile a custom service schedule.\r\nAvailable column size ranges:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3 - 50mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 25 - 500mm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Column Connection kits</p>\r\n<p>Connections available for column to HP/LPLC equipment. Featuring FEP tubing and a flanged PEEK adaptor designed to reduce the number of times your FEP lines kink.</p>\r\n', 'Chromatography Column Accessories', 'We offer both packed and unpacked Liquid Chromatography columns, as well as kits to connect them to your purification systems.<br/>\r\nAvailable column sizes and resins vary, please contact us to find out what hardware and packing services we can offer you!.\r\n', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'chromatography-column-accessories', '', '', '2025-12-18 11:47:03', '2025-12-18 11:47:03', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=415', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(417, 1, '2023-09-28 06:07:47', '2023-09-28 06:07:47', '<!--Custom liners made from industry leading films that fit your containers perfectly. Reduce mixing times with a baffle-free fit when paired with our drums.-->\r\n\r\nThe liners we offer are antistatic and constructed of LLDPE. Tank liners are designed to pair perfectly with our drums and bulk containers in order to:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>-Decrease torn liners</li>\r\n 	<li>-Decrease the amount of time spent fitting the liner</li>\r\n 	<li>-Reduce pockets of folded liner material to improve mixing and reduce the total time it takes</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Liners', 'Our tank liners are designed to eliminate cleaning validations while increasing the life span of your mixing tanks.\r\nIndividually packaged and made with heavy duty materials that can handle all your operation needs. Contact us for\r\nstandard sizes or for customization options.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'liners', '', '', '2025-12-18 11:45:24', '2025-12-18 11:45:24', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=417', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(418, 1, '2023-09-28 06:08:32', '2023-09-28 06:08:32', 'With load cells that handle up to ____ kg, our scales can be utilized as a standalone benchtop unit or can be integrated into one of our mixing systems.', 'Scales', 'With load cells that handle up to ____ kg, our scales can be utilized as a standalone benchtop unit or can be integrated into one of our mixing systems.', 'draft', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'scales', '', '', '2023-11-24 04:05:07', '2023-11-24 04:05:07', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=418', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(419, 1, '2023-09-28 06:09:22', '2023-09-28 06:09:22', '<!--Flexible and fully customizable, our 2D media, buffer, and processing bags offer a variety of advantages over rigid process containers.-->\r\nOur pool of 2D bag vendors allows us to offer bags for a variety of applications from simple transfers to mid-term storage. While rigid plastic biotainers can be fragile, increase shipping costs, and take away your processing space, 2D bag systems are a convenient flexible solution.\r\n\r\nFilms that are offered in our bags include industry leading and high quality Renolit polymers with full extractables/leachables profiles available upon request. Custom portage, tubing lines, and other accessories such as bag hangers are also available upon request.\r\n', '2D Bags', ' Our single use 2D Bag systems are ideal for every part of your operation, from media/buffer prep to harvest\r\nand more. These bags are tough and can handle all your biopharmaceutical liquids. Protect your work with our gamma\r\nirradiated systems, with multiple sizes available and customizable port options to streamline your operation.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2d-bags', '', '', '2025-12-18 11:44:41', '2025-12-18 11:44:41', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=419', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(420, 1, '2023-09-28 06:09:57', '2023-09-28 06:09:57', '<!--Our single use 3D Bag systems are built tough and chemically compatible to hold all your biopharmaceutical\r\nproducts. They offer a safe and convenient way to store large volumes. With multiple port customization options\r\navailable, it can improve current workflow, keeping projects moving more efficiently. Available in a wide range of sizes.-->\r\n\r\n<p>Our 3D bag offerings are a 100% custom solution. Examples of previous concepts we’ve previously designed include:</p>\r\n<p>1000L Bioreactor bags for use with a Rocker Table</p>\r\n<p>250L bags paired with our bulk containers for secondary containment</p>\r\n<p>200L bags for client supplied containers</p>\r\n<p>Converting Liners into bags for “Closed Systems”</p>\r\n<p>The design possibilities are endless. In addition to standard portage, we have also integrated anchored dip-tubes, powder transfer systems, and more. Contact our designers to build your 3D bioprocessing bag.</p>\r\n', '3D Bags', 'Our single use 3D Bag systems are built tough and chemically compatible to hold all your biopharmaceutical\r\nproducts. They offer a safe and convenient way to store large volumes. With multiple port customization options\r\navailable, it can improve current workflow, keeping projects moving more efficiently. Available in a wide range of sizes.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3d-bags', '', '', '2025-12-18 11:44:00', '2025-12-18 11:44:00', '', 0, 'http://off-ce.com/?post_type=products&#038;p=420', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(423, 1, '2023-09-28 06:26:30', '2023-09-28 06:26:30', '', 'product-banner2', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'product-banner2', '', '', '2023-10-06 09:38:53', '2023-10-06 09:38:53', '', 43, 'http://off-ce.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/product-banner2.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(424, 1, '2023-09-28 06:29:26', '2023-09-28 06:29:26', 'The right tubing is critical to the efficiency of your pumping application. We take into account your sizing, pressure, flow rate, chemical compatibility, tolerance, and welding needs to specify the perfect plumbing. Check out the major brands that we carry and work side by side with.\n\n', 'Tubing', 'The right tubing is critical to the efficiency of your pumping application. We take into account your sizing, pressure, flow rate, chemical compatibility, tolerance, and welding needs to specify the perfect plumbing. Check out the major brands that we carry and work side by side with.\n\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '283-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-09-28 06:29:26', '2023-09-28 06:29:26', '', 283, 'http://off-ce.com/?p=424', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
