(486, 1, '2023-10-06 10:44:33', '2023-10-06 10:44:33', 'Never assemble and sterilize your bioreactor kits on-site again. Our bioreactor line kits save you time by coming fully assembled and gamma irradiated.', 'Reactor Lines', 'Never assemble and sterilize your bioreactor kits on-site again. Our bioreactor line kits save you time by coming fully assembled and gamma irradiated.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '384-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-10-06 10:44:33', '2023-10-06 10:44:33', '', 384, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=486', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(488, 1, '2023-10-06 10:55:50', '2023-10-06 10:55:50', '', 'Dollies', 'Boost your production without compromising safety with our drum dollies. From 50L to 200L, these drum dollies\r\nwill ensure safe mobility to large drums in your facility.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'dollies', '', '', '2023-11-01 07:39:25', '2023-11-01 07:39:25', '', 0, 'https://bpssu.dev/?post_type=products&#038;p=488', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(489, 1, '2023-10-06 10:57:20', '2023-10-06 10:57:20', '<p>Instead of dedicating lab and warehouse space to permanent storage containers, our intermediate bulk containers are a compact and collapsible solution designed to handle a variety of fluid products. The containers are lightweight and easy to maneuver when paired with one of our stainless steel bulk container dollies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bulk containers can also be paired with liners and 3D bags to develop an all in one process container complete with secondary containment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contact us for sizing options.</p>\r\n', 'Bulk Containers (IBC)', 'Optimize bulk media storage with our IBC’s! Compatible for both 2D and 3D bags and\r\ncollapsible/stackable for easy storage. These IBC totes are lightweight, easy to maneuver, and simple to clean.\r\nCustomization is available to meet your process requirements, available in multiple sizes.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bulk-containers-ibc', '', '', '2023-11-23 07:12:29', '2023-11-23 07:12:29', '', 0, 'https://bpssu.dev/?post_type=products&#038;p=489', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(490, 1, '2023-10-06 10:58:42', '2023-10-06 10:58:42', 'We offer an array of filtration solutions, customized for the heaviest microbial load to the most volatile downstream solvents.\r\n\r\nThe filtration product brands that we work closely with include:\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">Sartorius</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">Meissner</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">Saint-Gobain</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">Tisch</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n\r\nDon’t see a configuration on our product table that suits your application? Contact us and let us know your needs!\r\nIf you’re having difficulty with a filtration process, we may be able to offer you an alternative recommendation or product to optimize your results- our designers have experience with evaluating and correcting suboptimal filtration processes.\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Filtration', 'Utilize our standardized single use filtration assemblies to maximize the efficiency of your bioprocesses today!\r\nWe offer a full range of filtration solutions for all aspects of your operation.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'filtration', '', '', '2025-12-18 11:42:58', '2025-12-18 11:42:58', '', 0, 'https://bpssu.dev/?post_type=products&#038;p=490', 0, 'products', '', 0),
