(540, 1, '2023-11-22 13:24:20', '2023-11-22 13:24:20', '<p>Custom bottle assemblies are available in a wide array of sizes. Unlike most other vendors of single use bottle systems, we not only offer customization of the cap, but can integrate portage directly into the walls of the bottle itself without compromising the structure and rigidity.</p>\n<p>If your organization already has a selection of bottles, we can provide custom cap assemblies separately. Cap customization ranges from 1 to 3 ports and can be configured with or without a dip-tube.\n', 'Bottles', 'Skip the cleaning and sterilization of your reusable bottles and confidently store fluids in our PETG gamma\nirradiated bottle systems. With multiple port options, the customization of these bottles is endless. Check out our\nstandardized bottle systems or contact us to create the perfect design for your process.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '181-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-22 13:24:20', '2023-11-22 13:24:20', '', 181, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=540', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(541, 1, '2023-11-01 07:12:28', '2023-11-01 07:12:28', '<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Forget about floor scales and dedicating precious lab space to permanent mixing stations. We offer several variations and scales of mobile mixing stations for media and buffer preparation. Our mobile mixing platforms can be configured to include:</span>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-A drive unit with shaft and impeller</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-A lab-rated balance</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-A user-friendly head unit for adjusting settings</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-Weight ticket printers</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-Drums</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-Liners</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-3D Bag systems</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-100% 316 stainless steel construction</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-and more!</span>', 'Mixing Systems', 'Forget about floor scales and dedicating precious lab space to permanent mixing stations. We offer several variations and scales of mobile mixing stations for media and buffer preparation.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'mixing-systems', '', '', '2025-12-18 11:41:33', '2025-12-18 11:41:33', '', 0, 'https://bpssu.dev/?post_type=products&#038;p=541', 0, 'products', '', 0),
(542, 1, '2023-11-01 07:39:21', '2023-11-01 07:39:21', '', 'Dollies', 'Boost your production without compromising safety with our drum dollies. From 50L to 200L, these drum dollies\nwill ensure safe mobility to large drums in your facility.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '488-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-01 07:39:21', '2023-11-01 07:39:21', '', 488, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=542', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(543, 1, '2023-11-01 07:39:37', '2023-11-01 07:39:37', 'With load cells that handle up to ____ kg, our scales can be utilized as a standalone benchtop unit or can be integrated into one of our mixing systems.', 'Scales', 'With load cells that handle up to ____ kg, our scales can be utilized as a standalone benchtop unit or can be integrated into one of our mixing systems.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '418-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-01 07:39:37', '2023-11-01 07:39:37', '', 418, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=543', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
