(602, 1, '2023-11-22 13:07:54', '2023-11-22 13:07:54', '<!--Our single use 3D Bag systems are built tough and chemically compatible to hold all your biopharmaceutical\nproducts. They offer a safe and convenient way to store large volumes. With multiple port customization options\navailable, it can improve current workflow, keeping projects moving more efficiently. Available in a wide range of sizes.-->', '3D Bags', 'Our single use 3D Bag systems are built tough and chemically compatible to hold all your biopharmaceutical\nproducts. They offer a safe and convenient way to store large volumes. With multiple port customization options\navailable, it can improve current workflow, keeping projects moving more efficiently. Available in a wide range of sizes.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '420-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-22 13:07:54', '2023-11-22 13:07:54', '', 420, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=602', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
