(613, 1, '2023-11-23 04:14:02', '2023-11-23 04:14:02', '<p>If your vendors are missing deadlines, Bioprocess Supplies is here to help you source on time or find suitable alternatives. We keep stock of components from our top suppliers, including:</p>\n<table style=\"border:1px solid black;\">\n<tr style=\"border:1px solid black;\">\n<td>Eldon James</td>\n<td>Colder Products Company</td>\n<td>Fluidflow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sartorius</td>\n<td>New Age</td>\n<td>VWR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accuflow Systems</td>\n<td>Watson Marlow</td>\n<td>Saint-Gobain</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<p>Contact us for availability and lead time. If you need something we don’t carry, chances are that we can get it!</p>', 'Components', 'We work with the leading biopharma extruders to keep our clients up to date with the latest in single-use technology. We keep stock of a variety of connectors, clamps, and filters in polypropylene, polysulfone, polycarbonate. Call us to discuss the latest in aseptic connection and disconnection technology.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '368-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-23 04:14:02', '2023-11-23 04:14:02', '', 368, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=613', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
