(617, 1, '2023-11-23 07:09:38', '2023-11-23 07:09:38', '<p>Instead of dedicating lab and warehouse space to permanent storage containers, our intermediate bulk containers are a compact and collapsible solution designed to handle a variety of fluid products. The containers are lightweight and easy to maneuver when paired with one of our stainless steel bulk container dollies.</p>\n\nBulk containers can also be paired with liners and 3D bags to develop an all in one process container complete with secondary containment.\n\nContact us for sizing options.\n', 'Bulk Containers (IBC)', 'Optimize bulk media storage with our IBC’s! Compatible for both 2D and 3D bags and\ncollapsible/stackable for easy storage. These IBC totes are lightweight, easy to maneuver, and simple to clean.\nCustomization is available to meet your process requirements, available in multiple sizes.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '489-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-23 07:09:38', '2023-11-23 07:09:38', '', 489, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=617', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(618, 1, '2023-11-23 07:10:24', '2023-11-23 07:10:24', '', 'IBC-Literature-2023', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'ibc-literature-2023', '', '', '2023-11-23 07:10:24', '2023-11-23 07:10:24', '', 489, 'https://bpssu.dev/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/IBC-Literature-2023.pdf', 0, 'attachment', 'application/pdf', 0),
(619, 1, '2023-11-23 07:12:23', '2023-11-23 07:12:23', '', 'Bulk_Containers', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'bulk_containers', '', '', '2023-11-23 07:12:23', '2023-11-23 07:12:23', '', 489, 'https://bpssu.dev/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Bulk_Containers.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(620, 1, '2023-11-23 07:14:22', '2023-11-23 07:14:22', '    Adjustable bed heights and reusable hardware- we source industry leading resins at an affordable rate. Packed and shipped from New Jersey, our supplier’s local distribution and advanced shipping practices ensure that your columns arrive without air bubbles or cracked walls. Repacking services available.', 'Chromatography Columns', '    Adjustable bed heights and reusable hardware- we source industry leading resins at an affordable rate. Packed and shipped from New Jersey, our supplier’s local distribution and advanced shipping practices ensure that your columns arrive without air bubbles or cracked walls. Repacking services available.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '414-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-23 07:14:22', '2023-11-23 07:14:22', '', 414, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=620', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(621, 1, '2023-11-23 07:22:33', '2023-11-23 07:22:33', '<!--Connections available for column to HP/LPLC equipment. Featuring FEP tubing and a flange designed to reduce the number of times your FEP lines kink.-->\n\n<strong>Omnifit Columns:</strong>\n<p>Adjustable bed heights and reusable hardware. We source from New Jersey and our supplier’s local distribution and advanced shipping practices ensure that your columns arrive without air bubbles or cracked walls.</p> \n<p>All columns come fully assembled and ready for use.</p>\n<p>Column packing and repacking/swapping services are available. Please reach out with your needs and we can compile a custom service schedule.\nAvailable column size ranges:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diameter: 3 - 50mm</li>\n<li>Overall Length: 25 - 500mm</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Column Connection kits</p>\n<p>Connections available for column to HP/LPLC equipment. Featuring FEP tubing and a flanged PEEK adaptor designed to reduce the number of times your FEP lines kink.  \n', 'Chromatography Column Accessories', '<!--Connections available for column to HP/LPLC equipment. Featuring FEP tubing and a flange designed to reduce the number of times your FEP lines kink.-->\nWe offer both packed and unpacked Liquid Chromatography columns, as well as kits to connect them to your purification systems.<br/>\nAvailable column sizes and resins vary, please contact us to find out what hardware and packing services we can offer you!.\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '415-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-23 07:22:33', '2023-11-23 07:22:33', '', 415, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=621', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(622, 1, '2023-11-23 08:30:45', '2023-11-23 08:30:45', '', 'Drums', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'drums-2', '', '', '2023-11-23 08:30:45', '2023-11-23 08:30:45', '', 372, 'https://bpssu.dev/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Drums.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(623, 1, '2023-11-23 08:32:24', '2023-11-23 08:32:24', '<p>LDPE Drums are available in sizes ranging from 50 to 500L, feature an extra heavy construction, and have an external flange/lip.</p>\n<p>Drums can be paired with lids, liners, or even a 3D bag system to develop a complete mixing platform or bioprocessing station.</p>\n<p>Purchase drums from Bioprocess Supplies and ensure your liners fit perfectly every time with our custom designed liners, optimized specifically for the drums that we offer.\n', 'Drums', 'Looking to mix, store, or transfer reagents? Check out our line of cylindrical polypropylene storage drums to\nproperly store your bioprocessing fluids. For your mixing purposes, we offer a range of sizes of Low Density Polyethylene\n(LDPE) mixing cylindrical drums. Contact us to find the size needed for your projects!', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '372-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-23 08:32:24', '2023-11-23 08:32:24', '', 372, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=623', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(624, 1, '2023-11-23 08:39:28', '2023-11-23 08:39:28', '', 'Process-filters', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'process-filters', '', '', '2023-11-23 08:39:28', '2023-11-23 08:39:28', '', 490, 'https://bpssu.dev/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Process-filters.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(625, 1, '2023-11-23 08:45:38', '2023-11-23 08:45:38', '<p>We offer an array of filtration solutions, customized for the heaviest microbial load to the most volatile downstream solvents. </p>\n<p>The filtration product brands that we work closely with include:</p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">Sartorius</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">Meissner</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">col-sm-4</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n                                                                                Tisch\n<p>Don’t see a configuration on our product table that suits your application? Contact us and let us know your needs!</p>\n<p>If you’re having difficulty with a filtration process, we may be able to offer you an alternative recommendation or product to optimize your results- our designers have experience with evaluating and correcting suboptimal filtration processes.</p>\n\n', 'Filtration', 'Utilize our standardized single use filtration assemblies to maximize the efficiency of your bioprocesses today!\nWe offer a full range of filtration solutions for all aspects of your operation.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '490-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-23 08:45:38', '2023-11-23 08:45:38', '', 490, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=625', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(626, 1, '2023-11-23 08:48:19', '2023-11-23 08:48:19', '', 'Filter-assemblies', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'filter-assemblies', '', '', '2023-11-23 08:48:19', '2023-11-23 08:48:19', '', 490, 'https://bpssu.dev/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Filter-assemblies.pdf', 0, 'attachment', 'application/pdf', 0),
(627, 1, '2023-11-23 09:04:13', '2023-11-23 09:04:13', '', 'Vent-Filters', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'vent-filters', '', '', '2023-11-23 09:04:13', '2023-11-23 09:04:13', '', 490, 'https://bpssu.dev/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Vent-Filters.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(628, 1, '2023-11-23 09:20:36', '2023-11-23 09:20:36', '<!--Custom liners made from industry leading films that fit your containers perfectly. Reduce mixing times with a baffle-free fit when paired with our drums.-->\n\n<p>The liners we offer are antistatic and constructed of LLDPE. Tank liners are designed to pair perfectly with our drums and bulk containers in order to:</p>\n<ul>\n-Decrease torn liners\n\n-Decrease the amount of time spent fitting the liner\n\n-Reduce pockets of folded liner material to improve mixing and reduce the total time it takes\n', 'Liners', 'Our tank liners are designed to eliminate cleaning validations while increasing the life span of your mixing tanks.\nIndividually packaged and made with heavy duty materials that can handle all your operation needs. Contact us for\nstandard sizes or for customization options.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '417-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-23 09:20:36', '2023-11-23 09:20:36', '', 417, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=628', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
