(641, 1, '2023-11-23 13:25:09', '2023-11-23 13:25:09', '<p>We can meet the demands of your next project no matter the size. We will work with you to create a customized kit to fulfill your specific needs. Our single use bioreactor kits are built in an ISO Class 7 cleanroom and are packaged and ready for desired sterilization. Work with our team to choose tubing and componentry to enable a faster turnaround, minimize labor costs, and lessen the chances of contamination in your next run.</p>', 'Bio-R accessories', 'Work with our designers to create custom fittings to mate capital equipment with your Bioreactors.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '385-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-23 13:25:09', '2023-11-23 13:25:09', '', 385, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=641', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
