(653, 1, '2023-11-23 13:57:46', '2023-11-23 13:57:46', '<p>If your vendors are missing deadlines, Bioprocess Supplies is here to help you source on time or find suitable alternatives. We keep stock of tubing from our top suppliers, including:</p>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">Flexlene </div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">EJ Prene</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">Bioprene</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">Pumpsil </div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">C-Flex</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">Pharmed</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">Advantaflex TPE   </div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">APST Silicone</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">Masterflex</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>Additional specialty tubing available on request</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contact us for availability and lead time. If you need something we don’t carry, chances are that we can get it!</p>\r\n', 'Tubing', 'The right tubing is critical to the efficiency of your pumping application. We take into account your sizing, pressure, flow rate, chemical compatibility, tolerance, and welding needs to specify the perfect plumbing. Check out the major brands that we carry and work side by side with.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'tubing-2', '', '', '2023-11-29 06:12:04', '2023-11-29 06:12:04', '', 0, 'https://bpssu.dev/?post_type=products&#038;p=653', 0, 'products', '', 0),
