(680, 1, '2023-11-29 16:19:12', '2023-11-29 16:19:12', '<b>Head Plates: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Have an accessory for use with your bioreactor but no way to mount it? Call us to discuss machining a custom adaptor or even an entirely custom configured headplate.</span>\n\n<b>Bolt Kits: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stripping bolts is never an easy fix, and can cause delays for your bioreactor runs. Our adjustable bolt kits are custom designed for the geometry of your headplate and feature limited thread to avoid stripping. </span>', 'Bolt Kits & Head-plates', 'Custom head plates and bolts for any bioreactor- made from high quality stainless steel.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '383-autosave-v1', '', '', '2023-11-29 16:19:12', '2023-11-29 16:19:12', '', 383, 'https://bpssu.dev/?p=680', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
