(11, 11, 'products_categories', 'We can meet the demands of your next project no matter the size. Work with our team to choose tubing and componentry to enable a faster turnaround, minimize labor costs, and lessen the chances of contamination in your next bioreactor run.', 0, 2),
(14, 14, 'product_category', '', 0, 3),
(15, 15, 'product_category', '', 0, 3),
(16, 16, 'product_category', '', 0, 4),
(17, 17, 'product_category', '', 0, 3),
(18, 18, 'products_categories', 'We work with the leading biopharma extruders to keep our clients up to date with the latest in single-use technology.', 0, 1),
(19, 19, 'products_categories', 'Keeping safety and sterility within your workplace is important to us, so we have come up with some great standardized designs to help your process.', 0, 6),
(20, 20, 'products_categories', 'Harvest, purification, and final fill/finish- let our single-use assemblies follow your product all the way through processing.', 0, 2),
(23, 23, 'products_categories', 'Media and Buffer solutions are a crucial ingredient to biological drug processing. The solutions are responsible for growing and protecting drug products and follow them through a majority of production. Ensuring the accuracy and sterility of Media and Buffer solutions is critical- So how they are prepared, filtered, transferred, and stored is an important part of the process.\r\nTo make preps easier, we have customized solutions to help streamline the process, without compromising sterility or quality. From bags and bottles, to filter assemblies and mixing systems: we have a full array of single-use equipment and accessories for every MBP Lab.\r\n', 0, 9),
(24, 24, 'products_categories', 'The right tubing is critical to the efficiency of your pumping application. We take into account your sizing, pressure, flow rate, chemical compatibility, tolerance, and welding needs to specify the perfect plumbing. Check out the major brands that we carry and work side by side with.', 0, 1),
(25, 25, 'post_tag', '', 0, 1),
(26, 26, 'post_tag', '', 0, 1),
